{'symbol': 'TFX', 'date': '2023-02-23 06:45:00', 'title': 'TELEFLEX ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "WAYNE, PA., FEB. 23, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TELEFLEX INCORPORATED (NYSE: TFX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF THIRTY-FOUR CENTS ($0.34) PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE MARCH 15, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 3, 2023. ADDITIONAL INFORMATION ABOUT TELEFLEX CAN BE OBTAINED FROM THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE AT TELEFLEX.COM ."}{'symbol': 'TFX', 'date': '2023-02-23 06:30:00', 'title': 'TELEFLEX REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': 'WAYNE, PA., FEB. 23, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TELEFLEX INCORPORATED (NYSE: TFX) (THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER ENDED DECEMBER\xa031, 2022.'}